This repository contains benchmark harness code only. It does not ship
GPU driver stacks, model weights, or cloud credentials.

Hugging Face / model weights
  LLM Serving workloads (vLLM, SGLang) may download third-party weights
  such as mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.3 at runtime. Those weights are subject
  to their own licenses. Provide HF_TOKEN in the environment when required.
  Do not commit tokens, cookies, or downloaded weight caches.

Local execution
  setup.sh and run_benchmark.sh are local-only. They do not take SSH
  hosts, IPs, or private keys. Validate on your own GPU host.

Sibling collector note (105 / 205)
  Both are the PyTorch Tensor Op Correctness Suite. The AMD 105 collector
  compares GPU output to a CPU FP32 reference. The NVIDIA 205 collector
  compares GPU output to a CPU FP64 reference. Same sweep knobs are not
  the same wall-clock work.

LLM Serving default
  A bare `bash run_benchmark.sh` runs the smoke profile (tiny local
  server). Pass --baseline or --extended to load the real model.
